 "evidence": "scripts/backfill_tax.py docstring: \"Recompute tax_cents for finalized invoices of one month.\" That contradicts the memory's rule that Invoice.tax_cents is never recomputed after finalization. Either the rule has an exception for backfills or the script conflicts with policy.",
 "source_file": "scripts/backfill_tax.py"
}
